   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">General question: Results related to the intended outcome 2016Question: Summarise results related to the intended outcome (this information will be sent to Open Aid)Answer: At the end of the project more or less all the planned activities had been implemented. The form and extent of some have changed along the way. Reporting has mainly been on activity level with little discussion on impact. However, on-site monitoring confirmed that the women&apos;s shelter seemed to be functioning well and that there was interesting work and cooperation done with the local community as well as a budding cooperation and network with other organisations working on women&apos;s rights and protection.</narrative>
